From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:29:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] webOS: show WhatsApp Channels

* Show WhatsApp Channels

The names and icons of followed Channels (newsletters) are fetched on
connect, which also creates their buddies. Joining a channel fetches
its last 50 posts. Posts that arrive twice (offline sync and history)
are dropped by id; the seen ids are kept next to the message cache.
The "ignore-newsletters" option therefore defaults to off.

* Route status updates to a status chat per sender

A status update goes to "<phone>@broadcast" instead of the sender's 1:1
chat, named after the sender, so the transport can file it apart from
the conversations. The "[STATUS] " prefix is dropped.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [webOS specific]
